  "description": "Certificate of\r\nLawful Proposed Development:&nbsp;Change of Use from HMO for up to 6 people (Use Class C4) to HMO for 7 people (Use Class Sui Generis); Cycle storage to rear; Refuse storage to front",
  "development_type": "Certificates of Lawful Development",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed use of the dwellinghouse as a House of Multiple Occupancy (HMO) for up to 7 person exceeds the limitations of Use Class C4 which limits the number of occupants to 6 persons. Therefore, the proposed development would fail to be within the tolerances of Class L of Part 3 of Schedule 2 of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
